":doc:`framediff_scanline <luaapifunctions>` and "
":doc:`framediff_scanline_finish <luaapifunctions>`, call this method to get "
"the number of pixels of difference that were found between the current and "
"previous template."
msgstr ""
":doc:`framediff_scanline_start <luaapifunctions>`, :doc:`framediff_scanline "
"<luaapifunctions>` 및 :doc:`framediff_scanline_finish <luaapifunctions>`\\ 를 "
"사용한 후, 이 메서드를 호출하여 현재 템플릿과 이전 템플릿 사이에서 발견된 차이 픽셀 수를 가져오십시오."

